  "industry_code": "CBB20(85℃)",
  "summary_zh": "HMP 是东莞博可威电子科技有限公司（BKW）的金属化聚丙烯膜 AC 电容器(轴向型)（行业型号 CBB20(85℃)），额定温度 85℃，额定电压 160VAC、250VAC、300VAC、400~450VAC，电容量范围 0.47μF~47μF；已取得 UL（E521522）认证；适用于温度补偿电路、定时与振荡回路、功率校正、开关电源耦合及 AC 滤波。",
  "summary_en": "BKW HMP: Metallized polypropylene film AC capacitor (Axial type) (industry code CBB20(85℃)). Rated temperature 85℃, rated voltage 160, 250, 300 and 400–450VAC, capacitance 0.47μF–47μF; UL approved (E521522); for temperature compensation, timing and oscillator circuits, power factor correction, SMPS coupling and AC filtering.",
